OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with rain, perhaps
OL,6,Flocally heavy at first. Becoming drier
OL,7,Finto the afternoon but remaining
OL,8,Fmostly cloudy with the odd light
OL,9,Fshower possible. Temperatures near
OL,10,Fnormal.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRather cloudy at first
OL,13,Fovernight with the odd light shower.
OL,14,FBecoming dry by dawn with clear spells
OL,15,Fdeveloping and feeling chilly.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FA dry, bright and largely
OL,18,Fsunny day across the region. Perhaps
OL,19,Fthe odd shower towards the coast, and
OL,20,Fbecoming breezy here too. Cold and
OL,21,Ffrosty overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
